Metric:
- id: mlflow.lineage_coverage_band
- name: 
- description: The Lineage Coverage Band metric evaluates the completeness of lineage metadata associated with MLflow runs, specifically focusing on the connections between parameters, artifacts, and models. It measures the extent to which these elements are documented and linked, providing insights into the traceability of the machine learning workflow. A high coverage indicates that all relevant components of the ML lifecycle are well-documented, facilitating reproducibility and accountability. Conversely, gaps in lineage coverage may signal missing links that could hinder understanding of model performance and decision-making processes. This metric is crucial for ensuring that all aspects of the ML experimentation and deployment pipeline are adequately captured and can be traced back for future reference or audits.

