Metric:
- id: aml.jobs_flow_band
- name: 
- description: The AML Jobs Flow Band metric evaluates the orchestration of Azure Machine Learning (AML) jobs, focusing on the efficiency and reliability of pipelines, step dependencies, and retry mechanisms. It measures how well the various components of the machine learning workflow interact and depend on one another, identifying potential bottlenecks or points of failure. This metric highlights instances where manual interventions are required, indicating brittle flows that may disrupt the automation of the ML lifecycle. By analyzing the orchestration of jobs, it provides insights into the robustness of the training and deployment pipelines. The scope includes all stages of the ML process, from experimentation to deployment, ensuring a comprehensive view of operational health.

