Metric:
- id: sm.experiments_lineage_band
- name: 
- description: This metric evaluates the completeness of lineage capture within SageMaker Experiments, focusing on the connections between datasets, code, and models throughout the machine learning lifecycle. It identifies any missing links that may hinder traceability and reproducibility of experiments, which are critical for understanding model performance and decision-making. The scope includes all components involved in the experimentation process, from data preparation to model training and evaluation. By flagging gaps in lineage, this metric helps ensure that all relevant artifacts are accounted for, facilitating better collaboration and compliance with best practices in ML development. Ultimately, it supports the integrity of the ML pipeline by promoting transparency and accountability in the experimentation process.

