- description: This metric measures the extent to which fairness and explainability artifacts generated by SageMaker Clarify are present and complete within a machine learning project. It specifically flags instances where bias reports or explanations are missing, indicating potential gaps in the assessment of model fairness and interpretability. The scope includes all artifacts produced during the model evaluation phase, ensuring that both fairness metrics and interpretability insights are adequately documented. By monitoring this metric, teams can identify areas where additional analysis is needed to ensure compliance with ethical standards and regulatory requirements. The metric serves as a critical checkpoint in the ML experimentation and deployment pipeline, promoting transparency and accountability in model development.

