Metric:
- id: cicd.policy_gates_band
- name: 
- description: This metric measures the effectiveness of policy gates within machine learning continuous integration and continuous deployment (CI/CD) pipelines. It evaluates the enforcement of various quality assurance mechanisms, including linting, automated tests, security scans, and approval workflows, that are designed to ensure code quality and compliance before deployment. The scope of this metric encompasses all stages of the ML lifecycle where code changes are introduced, from experimentation to production. A higher rate indicates a robust adherence to established policies, which can help mitigate risks associated with model deployment. Conversely, a lower rate may signal potential vulnerabilities or lapses in the CI/CD process, highlighting areas for improvement in governance and compliance practices.

